{"backgroundInformation":"This Fish Banks Flight Simulator is based entirely on the Fish Banks game of Meadows et al. and document D-4543-2 of the System Dynamics Education Project under the supervision of Jay.W. Forrester ( http://ocw.mit.edu/NR/rdonlyres/Sloan-School-of-Management/15-988Fall-1998-Spring-1999/8628D515-956A-43FB-B56C-3FAB4896FAE6/0/fish.pdf ).  EPA1321 students at Delft University play the Fish Banks, Ltd. game, develop a SD model of the underlying structure in order to develop a better understanding of the link between structure and behaviour of the system, and compared their models to the one uploaded here in order to validate them. Finally students need to explore the critical values of the system...","@type":"XMILEModel","modelId":"Fish_bank","sourceFile":"Fish_bank.xmile","simSpecs":{"method":"RK4","time_units":"Year","start":"2010","stop":"2025","dt":"0.25"},"variables":[{"type":"stock","name":"Fish","units":"fish","eqn":"INTIAL_FISH","inflows":["fish hatch rate"],"outflows":["fish death rate","total catch per year"]},{"type":"stock","name":"Ships","units":"ship","eqn":"INITIAL_SHIPS","inflows":["ship building rate"],"outflows":[]},{"type":"stock","name":"Total_Profits","units":"$","eqn":"INITIAL_TOTAL_PROFITS","inflows":["annual profits"],"outflows":[]},{"type":"aux","name":"annual_profits","units":"$/Year","eqn":"revenues-costs"},{"type":"aux","name":"catch_per_ship","units":"fish/(Year*ship)","eqn":"EFFECT_OF_DENSITY_ON_CATCH_PER_SHIP(density/NORMAL_DENSITY)"},{"type":"aux","name":"costs","units":"$/Year","eqn":"Ships*UNIT_SHIP_OPERATING_COST"},{"type":"aux","name":"death_fraction","units":"1/Year","eqn":"EFFECT_OF_FISH_AND_CARRYING_CAPACITY_ON_DEATH_FRACTION(Fish/CARRYING_CAPACITY)"},{"type":"aux","name":"density","units":"fish/(miles*miles)","eqn":"Fish/AREA"},{"type":"aux","name":"fish_death_rate","units":"fish/Year","eqn":"death_fraction*Fish"},{"type":"aux","name":"fish_hatch_rate","units":"fish/Year","eqn":"Fish*HATCH_FRACTION"},{"type":"aux","name":"FISH_PRICE","units":"$/fish","eqn":"GAME ( 20)"},{"type":"aux","name":"FRACTION_INVESTED","units":"Dmnl","eqn":"GAME ( 0.2)"},{"type":"aux","name":"revenues","units":"$/Year","eqn":"FISH_PRICE*total_catch_per_year"},{"type":"aux","name":"ship_building_rate","units":"ship/Year","eqn":"MAX(0,annual_profits*FRACTION_INVESTED/SHIP_COST)"},{"type":"aux","name":"SHIP_COST","units":"$/ship","eqn":"GAME ( 300)"},{"type":"aux","name":"total_catch_per_year","units":"fish/Year","eqn":"Ships*catch_per_ship"},{"type":"aux","name":"UNIT_SHIP_OPERATING_COST","units":"$/(Year*ship)","eqn":"GAME ( 250)"},{"type":"aux","name":"EFFECT_OF_DENSITY_ON_CATCH_PER_SHIP","units":"fish/(Year*ship)","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"EFFECT_OF_FISH_AND_CARRYING_CAPACITY_ON_DEATH_FRACTION","units":"1/Year","eqn":""},{"type":"aux","name":"AREA","units":"miles*miles","eqn":"100"},{"type":"aux","name":"CARRYING_CAPACITY","units":"fish","eqn":"1200"},{"type":"aux","name":"HATCH_FRACTION","units":"1/Year","eqn":"6"},{"type":"aux","name":"INITIAL_SHIPS","units":"ship","eqn":"10"},{"type":"aux","name":"INITIAL_TOTAL_PROFITS","units":"","eqn":"0"},{"type":"aux","name":"INTIAL_FISH","units":"","eqn":"1000"},{"type":"aux","name":"NORMAL_DENSITY","units":"fish/(miles*miles)","eqn":"1"}]}